  },
  {
    "id": 2028006010080,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "一度気になっちゃったら、ずっと気になっちゃって",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202800601/2028006010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうだったのか\r\nごめんな、作業の邪魔して",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2028006010090,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "いえ、そろそろ切り上げるところなので……\r\nプロデューサーさんの方は、難しいお仕事ですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202800601/2028006010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "autoWaitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 2028006010100,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "さっき、ため息ついてたから……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202800601/2028006010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "難しい……っていうのは、そうかもな\r\n俺じゃなくて、はるきが、だけど──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1700
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "実はな、ショートムービーの制作と出演の話を\r\nいただいたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2028006010110,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "わぁっ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
